            "Yes, because under the felony murder rule, all co-felons are strictly liable for any death that occurs during the commission of an inherently dangerous felony.",
            "No, because under the agency theory of felony murder, the lethal act must be committed by a felon or an agent acting in furtherance of the common criminal conspiracy.",
